## Why This Is Asked
This question probes cost-aware decision making in a multi-tenant LLM gateway, requiring concrete budgeting, latency-based routing, and a test plan. It matches beginner levels but with real-world constraints.

## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant daily token budget
- Latency thresholds for model selection
- Simple routing policy and observability
- Minimal test plan

## Code Example
```javascript
function routeToModel(tenant, latencyMs, remainingTokens){
  const budgetFrac = remainingTokens / tenant.dailyBudget;
  if (budgetFrac > 0.5 && latencyMs < 80) return 'fast';
  if (latencyMs < 120) return 'balanced';
  return 'accurate';
}
```

